class=\"nav-link text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-black hover:bg-black/5\" href=\"/about\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined nav-link-icon\">badge</span><span class=\"nav-link-label\">About</span></a><a class=\"nav-link text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-black hover:bg-black/5\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined nav-link-icon\">mail</span><span class=\"nav-link-label\">Contact</span></a></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-4\"><button id=\"nav-book-consultation-btn\" type=\"button\" class=\"group px-6 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold text-white bg-black hover:bg-zinc-800 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-black/20 transition-all duration-300\">Book Free Consultation</button></div><button id=\"mobile-menu-btn\" class=\"md:hidden w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white/60 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center hover:border-black hover:text-black transition-colors\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle Navigation\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" id=\"mobile-menu-icon\">menu</span></button></div></div></nav><div class=\"h-20\"></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"w-full\"><section class=\"lms-hero\" id=\"lms-hero-top\"><div class=\"lms-hero-content\"><div class=\"lms-hero-badge\"><span class=\"lms-hero-badge-dot\"></span><span class=\"lms-hero-badge-text\">Excellence in Engineering</span></div><h1>Architecting the future with precision code.</h1><p>We combine high-performance developer tools with a minimalist philosophy to deliver premium software solutions that scale with your vision.</p><a href=\"#lms-services\" class=\"lms-hero-scroll\" aria-label=\"Scroll to services\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">keyboard_arrow_down</span>Scroll</a></div></section><section class=\"lms-bento\" id=\"lms-services\"><div class=\"lms-bento-grid\"><div class=\"lms-card lms-col-8 lms-card-ai\"><div><div class=\"lms-icon-box\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">neurology</span></div><h3 class=\"lms-card-title\">AI Solutions</h3><p class=\"lms-card-desc\">Deploy state-of-the-art Large Language Models and custom neural architectures tailored to your specific operational workflows. We focus on ethical, scalable, and highly performant AI integration.</p><div class=\"lms-tags\"><span class=\"lms-tag\">LLMs</span><span class=\"lms-tag\">PyTorch</span><span class=\"lms-tag\">NLP</span></div></div><a class=\"lms-btn-primary\" href=\"/services/ai-solutions\">Learn More</a><div class=\"lms-card-watermark\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">neurology</span></div></div><div class=\"lms-card lms-col-4 lms-card-compact\"><div><div class=\"lms-icon-box\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">code</span></div><h3 class=\"lms-card-title\">Web Development</h3><p class=\"lms-card-desc\">High-performance web applications and e-commerce solutions built with modern technologies like PHP, Node.js, and React.</p></div><a class=\"lms-btn-outline\" href=\"/services/web-development\">Learn More</a></div><div class=\"lms-card lms-col-4\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\"><div><div class=\"lms-icon-box\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">code_blocks</span></div><h3 class=\"lms-card-title\">Custom Software</h3><p class=\"lms-card-desc\">Tailor-made enterprise solutions including SaaS development, legacy modernization, and workflow automation.</p></div><a class=\"lms-btn-outline\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Learn More</a></div><div class=\"lms-card-dark lms-col-8\"><div class=\"lms-card-dark-inner\"><div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"lms-icon-box\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">trending_up</span></div><h3 class=\"lms-card-title\">Digital Marketing</h3><p class=\"lms-card-desc\">Data-driven marketing strategies including SEO, PPC advertising, social media management, and content marketing to grow your online presence.</p><a class=\"lms-btn-green\" href=\"/services/digital-marketing\">Learn More</a></div><div class=\"lms-cyber-img\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB6u9Qsuk_Nz4sHUVGGy0UYfyvNm7Em8F5ZJrX2WyhSPI-8PVUup1GapuTWk2HX4i99YxAahgn4Es8rrPX4aTcbZEhoK89Xl6On8mR1tBxbg_JrP5FjwSUjCpMipKVDh_WnJvcefEoVVsldbeRL5ioCIBDvlIiSJQTECfol1KfCMGL-lIUcy6Fv3AcjXj9hPMRY5esGnACqHYhm45fIsiR4BwZKOykj-qOEbbOMn2XIhj-Tyq9TZgotI1GOpQ54Ff8hh3CYVfTlcbY\" alt=\"Digital marketing and analytics\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"lms-card lms-col-6\"><div class=\"lms-card-horiz\"><div class=\"lms-icon-box\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">phone_iphone</span></div><div><h3 class=\"lms-card-title\">Mobile App Development</h3><p class=\"lms-card-desc\">Native iOS, Android, and cross-platform mobile applications that users love, from concept to App Store deployment.</p><a class=\"lms-btn-link\" href=\"/services/mobile-app\">LEARN MORE<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon-sm\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"lms-card lms-col-6\"><div class=\"lms-card-horiz\"><div class=\"lms-icon-box\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">palette</span></div><div><h3 class=\"lms-card-title\">UI/UX Design</h3><p class=\"lms-card-desc\">Beautiful, intuitive, and user-centric interface design through research, prototyping, and usability testing.</p><a class=\"lms-btn-link\" href=\"/services/ui-ux\">LEARN MORE<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon-sm\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"lms-cta-section\"><div class=\"lms-cta-box\"><h2>Ready to engineer your next breakthrough?</h2><p>Our team is currently accepting high-impact projects. Let&#x27;s build something exceptional together.</p><div class=\"lms-cta-btns\"><a class=\"lms-btn-green\" style=\"padding:16px 40px\" href=\"/contact\">Start Your Project</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full py-16 bg-slate-9